5. Consequently this route presently gives no finite `td` bound. Its
   unconditional estimate is only

   \[
   0\le\mathcal E_{\rm MR}\le B^2,
   \qquad \operatorname{td}\le B^2\alpha\beta=\deg f\deg g, \tag{0.4}
