+\boxed{\deg\Psi\le C(\alpha\beta)^2.}               \tag{7.3}
+\]
+
+The sharp conjecture is `C=1`.
+
+By (2.6),
+
+\[
+\deg\Psi=\alpha\beta\operatorname{td}
+=(\alpha\beta)^2\mathcal E_{\rm MR}.                \tag{7.4}
+\]
